msgid "Voucher Captain requires WooCommerce to be installed and active."
msgstr ""
"Voucher Captain erfordert, dass WooCommerce installiert und aktiviert ist."

#. translators: %s: installed WooCommerce version
#: voucher-captain.php:84
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Voucher Captain requires WooCommerce 8.9 or newer (installed: %s). Please "
